        "hip acme-api\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" in acme-api: the steps in order, what Ostrom runs before an action, who says ",
        "yes, who is told. From Ostrom.\\\\\\\"\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n# Ship acme-api\\\\n\\\\nDecided by the team: Ostr",
        "om enforces it in this session.\\\\n\\\\n## A change is ready to ship (trigger)\\\\n\\\\n## Write the comm",
        "it message the team way (step)\\\\n\\\\nOne line, imperative.\\\\n\\\\nRules for this step:\\\\n- Commit m",
        "essages start with a verb in the imperative. (r-commit-style)\\\\n\\\\n## Unit tests pass (check)\\\\n\\\\",
        "nBefore push-main, Ostrom runs `npm test` in a sandbox (no network, no secret). If it fails, the action is",
        " refused with the output: fix the cause, never skip or weaken the check, then run the same command again.",
        "\\\\n\\\\n## Second (agent)\\\\n\\\\nHand this step to a sub-agent where your agent has them: `ostrom-seco",
        "nd` in Claude Code; in Codex, spawn_agent with agent_type `ostrom_second` (and task_name `ostrom_second`).",
        " Otherwise do it yourself. Then call `node_done` (MCP server \\\\\\\"ostrom-workflow\\\\\\\") with node \\",
        "\\\\\"wf-ship-second\\\\\\\" and a one-line summary of what was really done; never report a sub-agent that",
        " did not run.\\\\n\\\\nRead the diff once more.\\\\n\\\\n## Second look (agent)\\\\n\\\\nHand this step to",
        " a sub-agent where your agent has them: `ostrom-second-look` in Claude Code; in Codex, spawn_agent with ag",
        "ent_type `ostrom_second_look` (and task_name `ostrom_second_look`). Otherwise do it yourself. Then call `n",
        "ode_done` (MCP server \\\\\\\"ostrom-workflow\\\\\\\") with node \\\\\\\"wf-ship-review\\\\\\\" and a one-",
        "line summary of what was really done; never report a sub-agent that did not run.\\\\n\\\\nReview the diff.",
        "\\\\n\\\\n## Push to main (gate)\\\\n\\\\nA human yes is needed from rev-b or dev-a. When Ostrom refuses t",
        "he action \\\\\\\"waiting for a yes\\\\\\\", run the `ostrom wait <id>` command it gives, then the same co",
        "mmand again. Never work around a gate.\\\\n\\\\n## Tell the team (notify)\\\\n\\\\nAfter the action, Ostro",
